msgid "Boards and lists"
msgstr ""

msgid "Todo"
msgstr ""

msgid "Planned contents:"
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The boards overview and its sections: Starred, My Boards, Shared with me "
"and Templates. Each section can be collapsed, and the choice is "
"remembered."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Creating a board, empty or from a template (with a preview of the lists "
"the template will create — see :doc:`templates`)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The menu on a board's tile in the overview: renaming, changing the colour"
" (or resetting it to the default), starring, sharing (see :doc:`sharing`)"
" and e-mail notifications (see :doc:`notifications`)."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Reordering boards on the overview by drag and drop; the order, the "
"colours and the stars are yours alone."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Archiving a board, the \"Show Archived Boards\" view, restoring a board, "
"and deleting one permanently — only possible from the archive."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Inside a board, the board menu: adding a list, managing labels, sorting "
"the cards (custom order, due date, A-Z, Z-A — remembered per board, in "
"this browser), e-mail notifications, and the archive."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"Lists: adding, renaming, recolouring and reordering them by drag and "
"drop. The list menu: archiving every card in the list at once, archiving "
"the list."
msgstr ""

msgid ""
"The \"Archived Lists & Cards\" view: restoring or permanently deleting an"
" archived list or card."
msgstr ""

